/-!
# Jacobs-de Leeuw-Glicksberg projections and return times

Consolidated proofs and checked counterexamples for results of Barthmann, Farhangi
and Kuznetsova, arXiv:2509.24003v3. It uses Mathlib at the revision pinned by
the accompanying Lake project. The standalone README links the coverage table. Each source section
retains the declarations and proofs from its modular counterpart.

Key declarations include JdLG.decomposition_of_admissible,
JdLG.decomposition_of_unique_fixed_point,
JdLG.ultrafilter_limit_eq_jdlg_projection, and
JdLG.stable_iff_thicklySyndetic_weak_return.
-/

